# The warehouse example: price one order two ways in parallel, write a report
# file, and read it back. Everything the program may do is listed here.

warehouse is project
warehouse purpose "Price an order at list price and with a bulk discount, then write and read back a report"
warehouse target console
warehouse version "0.1.0"
warehouse language refined-1
warehouse standardLibrary 1
warehouse allows write console.stdout none
warehouse allows write fs.files "warehouse-*"
warehouse allows read fs.files "warehouse-*"
warehouse requires none
warehouse module pricing
warehouse module warehouse
warehouse entry warehouse.main
